"For Nextcloud, the base URL looks like https://cloud.example.com/remote.php/"
"dav/files/USERNAME"
msgstr ""
"Nextcloud의 경우 기본 URL은 https://cloud.example.com/remote.php/dav/files/"
"USERNAME 형식입니다"

